🏥 MediApp – Product Overview
🎯 Purpose

MediApp is a secure web-based medication management system that helps users:
Track medications
Schedule doses
Monitor adherence
Log health metrics
Review medication history
It is designed for individuals managing long-term prescriptions or multiple daily medications.

👤 Target Users
Individuals with chronic conditions
People taking multiple prescriptions
Users who struggle with medication consistency
Caregivers managing medication for someone else (future feature)

🔐 Core Principles
Secure (user-based authentication)
Simple UI
Reliable scheduling logic
Clear adherence reporting
Scalable architecture

🧱 Core Features (MVP)

1️⃣ User Accounts
What it does:
Register / Login
Each user only sees their own data
Secure authentication via ASP.NET Identity

Why it matters:
Medication data is sensitive and must be user-isolated.

2️⃣ Medication Management (CRUD)

Users can:
Add a medication
Edit medication details
Archive medications
View active vs archived

Fields include:
Name
Dosage (e.g., 20mg, 2 tablets)
Instructions (e.g., “Take with food”)
Start date
End date (optional)
Notes

3️⃣ Scheduling System

This is the core intelligence of the app.
Users can define how a medication should be taken:
Daily at specific times (e.g., 08:00 and 20:00)
Specific days of week (Mon/Wed/Fri)
Every X hours
As-needed (no reminders)
The system automatically generates upcoming dose events.

4️⃣ Dose Tracking
Each scheduled dose becomes a Dose Event.
For each event, a user can:
Mark as Taken
Skip

Let it become Missed

(Later: Snooze)

Each event stores:
Scheduled time
Actual action time
Status

5️⃣ Dashboard (Today View)

The main page shows:
Medications due now
Upcoming doses
Missed doses
Completed doses today
This gives immediate visibility.

6️⃣ Adherence Monitoring
The system calculates:
Adherence % = (Taken / Total Scheduled) * 100
Users can view:
7-day adherence
30-day adherence
Per-medication adherence
This gives measurable accountability.

7️⃣ Logs & History

Users can:
View all past dose events
Filter by date
Filter by medication
See action timestamps

8️⃣ Health Metrics (Optional MVP)
Users can manually log:
Weight
Blood pressure
Blood sugar
General notes
Later, these can be visualised in charts.

9️⃣ Export

Users can export:
Medication list
Dose history
Health metrics
As CSV files.